From: codEx Fork Bot <codex-fork-bot@localhost>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 01:16:54 +0800
Subject: ci: trim to Linux-only cargo CI and fork release workflow

Removes the bazel/v8/python/sdk release machinery and Windows/macOS
support so the fork builds the CLI with plain Cargo on Linux only.
blocking-ci now covers build, fmt, codex-tui tests, core unit tests,
codespell, and repo checks; the release workflow publishes
codex-<target>.tar.gz + sha256 assets and replaces an existing release
when a tag is re-pushed.
